{
  "name": "dsh-capability-aware",
  "version": "0.8.0",
  "description": "DSH 自我能力感知插件：自动扫描维护能力清单（插件/技能/记忆/连接器/自动化/工具/本机环境/硬件/软件），快速检索匹配能力及调用方式，缺失给补足引导；v0.8.0 并入会话错误账本——记录每个会话的报错并按插件/技能/对象/责任方等切面聚合，供自修复与自进化；装上即得（自供给 capability-lookup 技能 + 系统提示词段，免改用户任何文件）。",
  "type": "module",
  "main": "lib/index.js",
  "exports": {
    ".": "./lib/index.js",
    "./package.json": "./package.json"
  },
  "files": [
    "lib",
    "cap.mjs",
    "docs",
    "cordis.patch.yml",
    "README.md"
  ],
  "keywords": [
    "dsh",
    "deepseek-harness",
    "plugin",
    "capability",
    "registry",
    "self-aware",
    "error-ledger",
    "self-repair"
  ],
  "license": "MIT",
  "engines": {
    "node": ">=20"
  },
  "dsh": {
    "bundle": {
      "patch": "./cordis.patch.yml"
    }
  },
  "scripts": {
    "test": "node --test test/capability.test.mjs test/ledger.test.mjs"
  }
}
